uture runs.</p><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3438640/extras/461afca8726c004ce671f8186195be60.webp?t=1755266673\" width=600 height=39 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3438640/extras/3e6282a61ec92be2c4a04c9944472fa5.poster.avif?t=1755266673\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3438640/extras/3e6282a61ec92be2c4a04c9944472fa5.webm?t=1755266673\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3438640/extras/3e6282a61ec92be2c4a04c9944472fa5.mp4?t=1755266673\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your party from recruited units and modify your starting dice  for countless strategic possibilities.</p><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3438640/extras/7c33106ca3c0465ddbe94005addd3823.webp?t=1755266673\" width=600 height=39 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3438640/extras/0abcf9cec9b2b433a0d6dd951875abb4.poster.avif?t=1755266673\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3438640/extras/0abcf9cec9b2b433a0d6dd951875abb4.webm?t=1755266673\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3438640/extras/0abcf9cec9b2b433a0d6dd951875abb4.mp4?t=1755266673\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Optimize your party's effectiveness by chaining abilities and using complementary equipment.</p><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img clas